# 🎯 STRATEGY — Workspace Productize

> **Authority**: ws:/AGENTS.md + workspace-specific AGENTS.md
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/workspace-productize.ail`

---

## S-WP-1 — Vai trò Workspace

> **Workspace assembles the products.**

Workspace Layer (`ws:/`) là nơi Provider/Partner/Developer lấy các
semi-engine / secondary product / provider-partner-developer artifact
từ CAW để assemble, customize, configure, integrate, package thành
final product hoàn chỉnh.

## S-WP-2 — Workflow 6 bước

```text
caw:/minispace/{ws-*}/release/<artifact>
   ↓
1. IMPORT          (cargo dep / npm install / pip install)
   ↓
2. ASSEMBLE        (wire các artifact + business logic)
   ↓
3. CUSTOMIZE       (UI / branding / config)
   ↓
4. INTEGRATE       (cross-engine integration test)
   ↓
5. PACKAGE         (VSIX / MSI / AppImage / dmg / exe / helm chart)
   ↓
6. RELEASE         (gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release)
```

## S-WP-3 — Workspace Layout

```text
ws/<workspace>/
├── .know/                     # knowledge
├── .trae/                     # cognition
├── forge/                     # prototype (FAM.yaml, manifest.ail)
├── build/                     # production space (assemble/integrate/wire)
│   └── <module>/
│       ├── src/
│       ├── Cargo.toml
│       ├── BUILD.ail
│       └── build.rs
├── caw/                       # local CAW staging (read-only)
├── tests/                     # integration tests
├── scripts/                   # orchestration
├── vendor/                    # vendor deps
├── config/                    # routes, indexes
├── AGENTS.md                  # workspace-specific
├── README.md
└── package.json / Cargo.toml
```

## S-WP-4 — Customize Allowed

| Action | Authority |
|---|---|
| UI customization | CVA + Producer |
| Branding / theming | CVA |
| Config / env | Producer |
| Business logic | Producer (own code) |
| Engine source patch | ❌ FORBIDDEN (return to Forge) |
| CAW source patch | ❌ FORBIDDEN (return to CAW) |

## S-WP-5 — Package Formats

| Workspace | Package format | Command |
|---|---|---|
| `ws://hacex-studio` | VSIX | `bun run package` |
| `ws://hace-rosa` | wheel / exe | `pip wheel` / `cargo build` |
| `ws://hacex-zeus` | VSIX | `bun run package` |
| `ws://zeus-cloud` | helm chart | `helm package` |
| `ws://zeus-code` | exe / dmg / AppImage | `bun run package` |

## S-WP-6 — Distribution Channel

```text
ws:/<workspace>/
   ↓
package + sign + verify
   ↓
gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release (canonical)
   ↓
crates.io (nếu là Rust crate)
   ↓
Milky / Helio Cloud (nếu là runtime service)
   ↓
End User / Customer
```

## S-WP-7 — Quality Gate (BẮT BUỘC trước Release)

| Gate | Owner | Required |
|---|---|---|
| Unit test PASS | Tester | ✅ |
| Integration test PASS | Tester | ✅ |
| E2E smoke test PASS | Tester | ✅ |
| Security audit | Auditor | ✅ |
| Workspace-specific AGENTS.md compliance | Auditor | ✅ |
| Sign + verify artifact | Builder + Auditor | ✅ |
| CSA seal (nếu làm việc với engine parts) | CSA | ✅ |

